{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sRXekMHRks1795227563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>受東北季候風影響，天氣清涼。</p><p></p><p>早上市區普遍氣溫約15度，預測今日大致多雲及乾燥，日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約20度。</p><p></p><p>隨著一股偏東氣流，在下周初影響華南沿岸，氣溫會略為回升，而至下周中期，受東北季候風影響，氣溫會再度下降。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:03:58.300218+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T01:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T06:37:11.835963+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T02:57:22.249501+00:00","content_hash":"e00267a6b76f2c165ba62987642e2ff6636a15e2d05d978aee507f0325dc55ed","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:03:58.300218+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}